# www page conventions

## Script load order (feature pages)

```html
<script src="scripts/jquery.min.js"></script>
<!-- inline page logic -->
<script src="scripts/barcode-scanner.js"></script>  <!-- if scanning -->
<script src="scripts/bootstrap.min.js"></script>
<script src="scripts/custom.js"></script>
```

## API call pattern

```javascript
var data = new FormData();
data.append('toko', localStorage.getItem('toko'));
data.append('id', id);
$.ajax({
  type: 'POST',
  processData: false,
  contentType: false,
  data: data,
  url: 'https://store.kottykosmetik.com/Q_Stock_opname/cari_produk',
  dataType: 'json',
  success: function (data) { /* build HTML into #detail* */ },
  error: sqlerror
});
```

## Required on protected pages

- Call `cekLogin()` on load; redirect to `index.html` if no `tokenpda`
- Product/barcode lookups: skip API until input length >= 4
- Save endpoints: include `token` and `iduser` from localStorage
- Error responses: check `data.status == 'error'` then `showNotification(data.pesan, 'error')`

## Layout classes

- `card card-style` for content blocks
- `footer-bar-5` bottom nav on dashboard and feature pages
- `header header-fixed header-auto-show` top bar
